{"agent":"fix-complete-gates","data":{"body":"Research R-stale-after-merge. Gates record a content id of the tree they ran on (source_tree: every path's mode+blob id, .ddflow/ excluded, computed without writing objects) next to tree_sha. complete compares it against the item's worktree while one exists, and after merge (worktree removed, or claimed without one) against the merged branch head (second parent of the landing merge commit, else the landed commit) instead of the primary checkout. Legacy evidence with only tree_sha 'X+clean' compares commit X's content. The NOTE says what differs (the files, when knowable). Only a real difference warns.","globs":["ddflow/services/completion.py","ddflow/services/gates.py","ddflow/api/gates.py","tests/test_stale_after_merge.py"],"line":"","needs":[],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":[],"title":"complete's stale-evidence NOTE compares content trees, and after merge compares against the branch that landed, naming what differs (fixes bugs Bd86b05a8f8, Ba84119f707, B613cb67194)"},"id":"e29590e63804a869db2246e19","kind":"task.added","lamport":5918,"schema":1,"subject":"B-fix-stale-after-merge","ts":"2026-10-01T18:43:25.643110Z"}
{"agent":"fix-complete-gates","data":{"body":"Research R-gate-run-output-lost, R-gate-reason-help. run_command_gate writes the whole output to .ddflow/runs/<item>/<gate>-<ts>.log (a self-ignoring directory) and records output_log next to output_digest, so the digest can be checked; summary lines (pytest '=== N failed ... ===') from the WHOLE output are recorded, so a rerun-on-failure gate cannot hide its first pass behind the tail. gate record records --output-file's path as well. CLI help for --outcome/--reason names the requirement.","globs":["ddflow/services/gates.py","ddflow/api/gates.py","ddflow/surfaces/cli.py","tests/test_gate_output_evidence.py"],"line":"","needs":["B-fix-stale-after-merge"],"parent":"","priority":100,"tags":[],"title":"gate run keeps its full output in a per-run log next to the digest and lifts the suite's summary lines; gate record --help says --reason is required for failed/unavailable/partial (fixes bugs Bac392907b1, Be097545791)"},"id":"e80e58ee445b97ea70b778035","kind":"task.added","lamport":5919,"schema":1,"subject":"B-fix-gate-output-evidence","ts":"2026-10-01T18:43:26.054314Z"}
